{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 341.0, 468.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [27.80615234375, 22.8515625, 140.46192932128906, 29.78643798828125], "text": "", "type": "PageHeader"}, {"bbox": [305.03515625, 23.080078125, 311.8110046386719, 29.78643798828125], "text": "", "type": "PageHeader"}, {"bbox": [40.46044921875, 82.72265625, 155.95140075683594, 255.16099548339844], "text": "Last year we awarded 1,092 scholarships to students from 65 countries.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [172.0015106201172, 75.8671875, 297.74951171875, 150.1934814453125], "text": "\"We are all different. Writing about our dreams and accolades in a motivational letter is challenging. Do not be afraid to brag about your achievements, take pride in who you are and show just how big you can dream.\"", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [175.828125, 155.619140625, 281.9374084472656, 172.2762451171875], "text": "Rumbidzai Davidzo Mudzamiri, Zimbabwe", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [167.952490234375, 174.403125, 264.291650390625, 268.9171875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [24.0431640625, 307.6734375, 110.4919921875, 406.209375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [114.88769531249999, 334.08984375, 311.3407287597656, 380.99019622802734], "text": "\"I felt satisfaction when I was awarded a scholarship and this was fundamental for me to take the decision to move here. It's not hard to apply, my main advice is to find your motivation and just apply.\"", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [120.03219604492188, 386.419921875, 200.0981903076172, 394.6728515625], "text": "Nicolas Nieto, Colombia", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [42.45849609375, 432.80859375, 199.99156188964844, 442.7145290374756], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "Guide-for-international-students-web.pdf", "page_index": 64, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/Guide-for-international-students-web.pdf", "source": "marker"}